# Internal-only coupons-DB dev tooling (real-schema-adjacent, never
# committed to the public repo — see DESIGN.md's secrecy forward-rule).
apps/caramel-app/scripts/internal/

# Internal audit archive (cycle artifacts, findings, onload prompts) — kept
# locally by maintainers, never published (same policy as scripts/internal).
/audit/
/.playwright-mcp/

# Throwaway QA repros and exploration scripts. Lives INSIDE the repo (not the
# system temp dir) purely so a script here still resolves workspace deps like
# playwright from the root node_modules. Nothing here is ever committed — a
# fresh session must not be able to mistake a fossil repro for live tasking.
/.scratch/

# ext-probe run output: full logs, screenshots and the disposable browser
# profile each run creates and deletes (tools/ext-probe/README.md). Evidence
# from a specific run, never repo content.
/.ext-probe/
